      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-26101-26110">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26110-26122"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26122-26125">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26125-26140"><rb>色</rb><rt>いろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26140-26167">のたゞならないのを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26167-26179"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26179-26185">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26185-26203"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26203-26206">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26206-26233"><rb>心細</rb><rt>こゝろぼそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26233-26236">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26236-26251"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26251-26268">しかつた。</seg></p>
