      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-26564-26573">この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26573-26588"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26588-26591">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26591-26609"><rb>鼠</rb><rt>ねずみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26609-26612">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26612-26627"><rb>憎</rb><rt>にく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26627-26636">さは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26636-26660"><rb>近頃</rb><rt>ちかごろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26660-26663">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26663-26696"><rb>片腹痛</rb><rt>かたはらいた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26696-26702">く、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26702-26723"><rb>苦笑</rb><rt>くせう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26723-26750">をさせられる、あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26750-26786"><rb>流言蜚語</rb><rt>りうげんひご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26786-26795">とかを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26795-26813"><rb>逞</rb><rt>たくま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26813-26828">しうして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26828-26861"><rb>女小兒</rb><rt>をんなこども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26861-26864">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26864-26882"><rb>脅</rb><rt>おびや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26882-26888">かす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26888-26909"><rb>輩</rb><rt>ともがら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26909-26912">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26912-26927"><rb>憎</rb><rt>にく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26927-26965">さとおなじであつた。……</seg></p>
