        <p>「お、お、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47995-48019"><rb>周南</rb><rt>しうなん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48019-48025">よ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48025-48043"><rb>汝</rb><rt>なんぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48043-48046">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48046-48070"><rb>今日</rb><rt>こんにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48070-48073">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48073-48088"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48088-48094">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48094-48109"><rb>當</rb><rt>まさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48109-48112">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48112-48124"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby>ぬべきぞ。」</p>
