        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55053-55083"><rb>暴風雨</rb><rt>ばうふうう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55083-55086">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55086-55101"><rb>年</rb><rt>とし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55101-55122">から、ばつたり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55122-55134"><rb>來</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55134-55140">なく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55140-55152"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55152-55173">つた。それが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55173-55194"><rb>今年</rb><rt>ことし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55194-55212">、しかもあの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55212-55242"><rb>大地震</rb><rt>おほぢしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55242-55245">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55245-55260"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55260-55263">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55263-55275"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55275-55278">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55278-55302"><rb>暮方</rb><rt>くれがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55302-55308">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55308-55323"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55323-55326">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55326-55341"><rb>波</rb><rt>なみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55341-55353">のやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55353-55365"><rb>群</rb><rt>む</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55365-55371">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55371-55386"><rb>渡</rb><rt>わた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55386-55413">りついた。ぽぷらの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55413-55425"><rb>樹</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55425-55440">に、どつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="r