</rb><rt>こずゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55863-55866">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55866-55881"><rb>靜</rb><rt>しづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55881-55893">まつたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55893-55908"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55908-55941">ふと、チチツ、チチツと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55941-55953"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55953-55956">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55956-55968"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55968-55974">てて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55974-55989"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55989-55998">パツと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55998-56013"><rb>枝</rb><rt>えだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-56013-56016">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-56016-56040"><rb>飛上</rb><rt>とびあが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-56040-56046">る。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-56046-56070"><rb>曉方</rb><rt>あけがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-56070-56076">まで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-56076-56088"><rb>止</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-56088-56091">む</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-56091-56103"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-56103-56123">がなかつた。</seg></p>
