        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-76201-76210">が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76210-76225"><rb>蛇</rb><rt>へび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76225-76240">ではない。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76240-76252"><rb>這</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76252-76258">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76258-76285"><rb>肩車</rb><rt>かたぐるま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76285-76294">した、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76294-76312"><rb>鼬</rb><rt>いたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76312-76315">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76315-76330"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76330-76333">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76333-76348"><rb>列</rb><rt>れつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76348-76351">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76351-76366"><rb>亂</rb><rt>みだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76366-76392">れたのであつた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76395-76416"><rb>大野</rb><rt>おほの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76416-76419">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76419-76437"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76437-76440">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76440-76458"><rb>頷</rb><rt>うなづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76458-76491">かれて、そのはたらきも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76491-76506"><rb>察</rb><rt>さつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76506-76523">しらるゝ。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-76523-76583">かの、（リノキ、チツキテビー）よ。わが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76583-76622"><rb>鼬將軍</rb><rt>いたちしやうぐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76622-76643">よ。いたづらに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76643-76658"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76658-76664">など</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76664-76679"><rb>構</rb><rt>かま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76679-76688">ふな。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76688-76709"><rb>毒蛇</rb><rt>コブラ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76709-76712">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76712-76736"><rb>咬倒</rb><rt>かみたふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76736-76754">したあとは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76754-76772"><rb>希</rb><rt>ねがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76772-76778">くは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76778-76796"><rb>鼠</rb><rt>ねずみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76796-76799">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76799-76811"><rb>獵</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76811-76817">れ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76817-76832"><rb>蠅</rb><rt>はへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76832-76838">では</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76838-76868"><rb>役不足</rb><rt>やくぶそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76868-76883">であらうも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76883-76895"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76895-76916">れない。きみは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76916-76940"><rb>獸中</rb><rt>ぢうちう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76940-76943">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76943-76964"><rb>隼</rb><rt>はやぶさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76964-76984">である。……</seg></p>
      </div>
